 justify-between gap-4 text-start font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">كم يستغرق التوصيل؟<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3"><p data-node-id="d1-n22" data-node-type="paragraph" class="whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-(--sf-muted)">القاهرة والجيزة من يوم إلى يومين، وباقي المحافظات من ٢ إلى ٦ أيام.</p></div></details><details data-node-id="d1-n23" data-node-type="accordionItem" class="group border-b border-(--sf-line) py-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-start font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">هل التوصيل متاح لكل المحافظات؟<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3"><p data-node-id="d1-n24" data-node-type="paragraph" class="whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-(--sf-muted)">نعم، نوصل لكل محافظات مصر.</p></div></details></div></div><div data-node-id="d1-n25" data-node-type="vFlex" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><span data-node-id="d1-n26" data-node-type="badge" class="inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full bg-(--sf-shelf) px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">الدفع والاسترجاع</span><div data-node-id="d1-n27" data-node-type="accordion" class="flex flex-col"><details data-node-id="d1-n28" data-node-type="accordionItem" class="group border-b border-(--sf-line) py-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-start font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">ما طرق الدفع المتاحة؟<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3"><p data-node-id="d1-n29" data-node-type="paragraph" class="whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-(--sf-muted)">الدفع عند الاستلام، والبطاقات، والمحافظ الإلكترونية، وإنستاباي.</p></div></details><details data-node-id="d1-n30" data-node-type="accordionItem" class="group border-b border-(--sf-line) py-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-start font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">ما سياسة الاسترجاع؟<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3"><p data-node-id="d1-n31" data-node-type="paragraph" class="whitespace-pre-line text-pretty leading-relaxed text-(--sf-muted)">يمكنك إرجاع أي منتج غير مستخدم خلال ١٤ يومًا في علبته الأصلية.</p></div></details></div></div></div></div></section></div>"`;

